PHASE 5 UI HOSTILE AUDIT — BROWSER REPRODUCTION
Date: 2026-10-11 (Asia/Kolkata)
Target: local Fairwork UI at http://localhost:3000/ (local chain 31337)
Result: reproduced unsaved private proposal draft visible after switching from Client to Freelancer role.

Reproduction steps
1. In the local UI, select the seeded Client role (0x7099…79C8) and sign in.
2. Open “Create a private agreement”. Enter the synthetic title PHASE5_DRAFT_PRIVATE_SENTINEL; leave it unsaved and do not submit.
3. Close the form. Switch the local role to the seeded Freelancer (0x3C44…93BC) and sign in.
4. Reopen “Create a private agreement”. The form still displays PHASE5_DRAFT_PRIVATE_SENTINEL while the page identifies the current role as Freelancer.
5. Stop. No agreement was submitted, no transaction was sent, and the sentinel is synthetic audit data.

