Screenshot evidence
The browser screenshot was captured inline through the CUA screenshot API during the same observed state; it showed the open proposal form and PHASE5_DRAFT_PRIVATE_SENTINEL. The API returned 43,935 PNG bytes; SHA-256: cb4338910c760ed652b68abe4ff7c40f78431ede38ab4109e0ab79604a4a17e4.
The CUA API displayed the screenshot in its tool result but exposed no workspace file sink. Therefore this log records its digest and the AX/steps rather than claiming a local PNG file exists.

Relevant source locations
- apps/web/components/EscrowDashboard.tsx:245-249 clears the authenticated private caches but leaves agreement, milestoneDrafts, showAgreement, and confirmSummary state untouched.
- apps/web/components/EscrowDashboard.tsx:400-413 invokes logout/clearPrivate on wallet account change.
- apps/web/components/EscrowDashboard.tsx:442-454 switches demo roles through logout and updates the local wallet.
- apps/web/components/EscrowDashboard.tsx:157-160 declares the proposal draft and modal state that survives the switch.

Expected privacy behavior
A wallet or role context change should clear the private agreement draft and close private forms/confirmation summaries before another wallet can use the UI. See spec.md A-37/A-47 and HERO_PROMPT.md section 3.
